== Effects ==
* Upon use, turns a random item in the current room that costs money or hearts into a pedestal item that can be taken for free.
* While held, guarantees a random item or pickup from the {{r|Shop}} to be half price.

== Notes ==
* Coupon has a 1% chance to drop from destroying normal {{e|Shopkeeper}}s.
* Using Coupon in a {{r|Devil Room}} and taking that free item does not affect or remove the chances for {{r|Angel Room}}s.
* Using Coupon in [[Greed mode]] does not restock the taken item or consumable.
* Using Coupon in a Shop while holding {{i|Restock}} will not respawn a new item after taking the free one.
* {{dlc+|r}} Using Coupon as {{c|The Lost}} or {{c|Tainted Lost}} allows multiple Devil deals to be taken.{{dlc-}}

== Synergies ==
* {{Book of Virtues synergy|description=Spawns green wisps on the middle ring. The wisps fire three tears at a time, similarly to {{i|The Inner Eye}}. However, all of these wisps are destroyed if Isaac buys something using money. Does not affect wisps other than ones made by this item.}}
* {{i|Car Battery}}: Makes two items free upon use.
* {{i|Satanic Bible|r}}: The Devil deal in the boss room can be acquired for free.
* {{i|Steam Sale|nr}}: The discounts stack.

